{"subject":"Het programma & tijdschema — JVO Sportdag","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"nl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n<meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\">\n<title>Het programma &amp; tijdschema — JVO Sportdag</title>\n<!--[if !mso]><!-->\n<style>\n@font-face { font-family:'Unbounded'; font-style:normal; font-weight:500 900; src:url(https://sagek17.github.io/fonts/unbounded-var-latin.woff2) format('woff2'); }\n:root { color-scheme: light dark; supported-color-schemes: light dark; }\n@media (max-width:480px) {\n  .sh-rand { padding-left:20px !important; padding-right:20px !important; }\n  .sh-kop { font-size:22px !important; }\n}\n</style>\n<!--<![endif]-->\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:#06193A; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;\">\n<div style=\"display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; mso-hide:all;\">Programma &amp; tijdschema — JVO Sportdag</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#06193A\" style=\"background:#06193A;\">\n  <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px; width:100%;\">\n\n      <!-- Merkbalk -->\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px 20px;\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n          <td valign=\"middle\" width=\"44\" style=\"width:44px;\"><img src=\"https://sagek17.github.io/mail/jvo-logo.png\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" alt=\"JVO\" style=\"display:block; width:44px; height:44px; border:0; border-radius:22px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:800; color:#F6F7FB;\" /></td>\n          <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding-left:12px; font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace; font-size:11px; line-height:1.5; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#B9C2D8;\"><b style=\"color:#F6F7FB; font-weight:700;\">Jeugdgroep van Oranje</b><br/>Sportdag</td>\n        </tr></table>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <!-- Kaartje -->\n      <tr><td bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF; border-radius:18px;\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n          <tr><td colspan=\"3\" class=\"sh-rand\" style=\"padding:14px 24px 12px 32px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace; font-size:11px; line-height:1.5; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#C4382E;\">Programma &amp; tijdschema</td>\n              <td valign=\"middle\" align=\"right\" width=\"58\" style=\"width:58px;\"><img src=\"https://sagek17.github.io/mail/sport-beker.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block; width:46px; height:46px; border:0; margin-left:12px;\" /></td>\n            </tr></table>\n          </td></tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td width=\"9\" bgcolor=\"#06193A\" style=\"width:9px; height:18px; background:#06193A; border-radius:0 9px 9px 0; font-size:0; line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            <td style=\"padding:0 12px; font-size:0; line-height:0;\"><div style=\"height:0; border-top:2px dashed #AEB5C6; font-size:0; line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td>\n            <td width=\"9\" bgcolor=\"#06193A\" style=\"width:9px; height:18px; background:#06193A; border-radius:9px 0 0 9px; font-size:0; line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr><td colspan=\"3\" class=\"sh-rand\" style=\"padding:22px 32px 32px;\">\n            <h1 class=\"sh-kop\" style=\"margin:0 0 20px; font-family:'Unbounded','Arial Rounded MT Bold','Arial Black','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:26px; font-weight:900; line-height:1.12; letter-spacing:-0.02em; color:#06193A; overflow-wrap:break-word;\">Zo ziet de dag eruit</h1>\n            <div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#06193A;\">\n              \n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;\">Hoi Captain — het is bijna zover voor team <b style=\"color:#06193A; font-weight:600;\">Jouw team</b>. Hieronder de tijden van de dag, de volledige poule-indeling en hoe je je naar de finale werkt.</p>\n\n      \n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:18px 0; background:#F3F5FA; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #D5DAE8;\">\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 18px;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#4A4F72; padding-bottom:4px;\">Wanneer</td>\n        <td style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#4A4F72; padding-bottom:4px;\">Locatie</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right:14px;\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Unbounded','Arial Rounded MT Bold','Arial Black','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:18px; font-weight:900; color:#06193A; line-height:1.2; text-transform:none; font-size:15px; line-height:1.25; letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">Zondag 22 november 2026</div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:4px; font-size:13px; color:#06193A;\">Inloop 08:30 · Start 09:00 · Eind ± 14:00</div>\n        </td>\n        <td valign=\"top\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:'Unbounded','Arial Rounded MT Bold','Arial Black','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:18px; font-weight:900; color:#06193A; line-height:1.2; text-transform:none; font-size:15px; line-height:1.25; letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">Sportcampus Zuiderpark, Den Haag</div>\n          <div style=\"margin-top:4px; font-size:13px; color:#06193A;\">Mr. P. Droogleever Fortuynweg 22, 2533 SR Den Haag</div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n\n      \n    <div style=\"font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:#06193A; margin:20px 0 8px;\">Het dagprogramma</div>\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 4px; background:#F3F5FA; border:1px solid #D5DAE8; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden;\">\n      \n    <tr>\n      <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #D5DAE8; font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.04em; color:#06193A; white-space:nowrap; width:76px;\">08:00</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #D5DAE8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:14px; color:#06193A; font-weight:600;\">Teams aanwezig</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#4A4F72; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.5;\">Kleedkamers, inchecken met je team-QR en een warming-up.</div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #D5DAE8; font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.04em; color:#06193A; white-space:nowrap; width:76px;\">08:30</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #D5DAE8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:14px; color:#06193A; font-weight:600;\">Deuren open</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#4A4F72; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.5;\">Inloop voor bezoekers en publiek.</div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #D5DAE8; font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.04em; color:#06193A; white-space:nowrap; width:76px;\">09:00</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #D5DAE8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:14px; color:#06193A; font-weight:600;\">Aftrap toernooi</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#4A4F72; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.5;\">De poulefase begint.</div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #D5DAE8; font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.04em; color:#06193A; white-space:nowrap; width:76px;\">Daarna</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #D5DAE8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:14px; color:#06193A; font-weight:600;\">Knock-out</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#4A4F72; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.5;\">Play-offs, kwart- en halve finales — op weg naar de finale.</div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #D5DAE8; font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.04em; color:#06193A; white-space:nowrap; width:76px;\">Slotstuk</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #D5DAE8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:14px; color:#06193A; font-weight:600;\">Finale &amp; prijsuitreiking</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#4A4F72; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.5;\">De finale, en daarna de prijsuitreiking.</div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #D5DAE8; font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.04em; color:#06193A; white-space:nowrap; width:76px;\">± 14:00</td>\n      <td style=\"padding:11px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #D5DAE8;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:14px; color:#06193A; font-weight:600;\">Einde</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#4A4F72; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.5;\">Afsluiting van de JVO Sportdag. Het toernooi kan uitlopen — de app toont live de verwachte eindtijd.</div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    </table>\n\n      \n\n      <p style=\"margin:14px 0; padding:12px 15px; background:#FFF4EC; border:1px solid #FFC9A6; border-radius:10px; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55;\">\n        <b style=\"color:#06193A; font-weight:600;\">Let op — dit kan nog veranderen.</b><br/>\n        De poule-indeling en je tegenstanders kunnen vóór aanvang nog wijzigen. De app laat altijd de <b style=\"color:#06193A; font-weight:600;\">actuele indeling en tijden</b> zien.\n      </p>\n\n      \n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:16px 0; background:#FFF4EC; border:1px solid #FFC9A6; border-radius:10px;\">\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:14px 18px;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px; font-weight:600; color:#06193A; margin-bottom:4px;\">Hoe werk je je naar de finale?</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#06193A; line-height:1.5;\">De 4 poulewinnaars én de 2 beste nummers 2 gaan direct door naar de kwartfinale. De 2 laagste nummers 2 spelen samen met de 2 beste nummers 3 een play-off om de laatste 2 tickets.</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#4A4F72; margin-top:8px;\"><b style=\"color:#06193A; font-weight:600;\">10 door · 6 af · 8 in de kwartfinale</b> · Poules → play-off → kwartfinale → halve finale → finale (+ duel om plek 3)</div>\n        </td></tr>\n      </table>\n\n      \n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:18px 0; background:#EEF2FA; border:1px solid #AEB9D3; border-radius:8px;\">\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 18px;\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#06193A; margin-bottom:6px;\">Live programma</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:14px; color:#06193A; line-height:1.55;\">Volg het toernooi live: poules, het wedstrijdschema, de standen en de knock-out — bijgewerkt terwijl er gespeeld wordt. <a href=\"https://sagek17.github.io/toernooi\" style=\"color:#06193A; text-decoration:underline;\">Open het live programma →</a></div>\n        </td></tr>\n      </table>\n\n      \n\n      \n\n      <p style=\"margin:14px 0; font-size:13px; color:#4A4F72;\">Tijden kunnen op de dag iets schuiven — <b style=\"color:#06193A; font-weight:600;\">de app is leidend</b>. Neem je team-QR mee voor de check-in. <a href=\"https://sagek17.github.io/spelregels\" style=\"color:#06193A; text-decoration:underline;\">Spelregels →</a></p>\n\n      <p style=\"margin:18px 0 0;\">Tot dan — en succes!</p>\n    \n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:18px 0; background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #FFC9A6; border-radius:8px;\">\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 18px;\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#C4382E; margin-bottom:10px;\">Mijn team</div>\n          <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:0;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FF6B1A\" style=\"background:#FF6B1A; border-radius:999px; mso-padding-alt:12px 22px;\"><a href=\"https://sagek17.github.io/mijn\" style=\"display:inline-block; padding:12px 22px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.25; font-weight:700; color:#06193A; text-decoration:none; border-radius:999px;\">Open Mijn team</a></td></tr></table>\n          <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0; font-size:13px; line-height:1.55; color:#4A4F72;\">Status, QR en je wedstrijden op één plek. Bewaar deze mail: de knop is je sleutel.</p>\n        </td></tr>\n      </table>\n            </div>\n          </td></tr>\n        </table>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 0 8px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin:0;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#FF6B1A\" style=\"background:#FF6B1A; border-radius:999px; mso-padding-alt:16px 32px;\"><a href=\"https://sagek17.github.io/toernooi\" style=\"display:inline-block; padding:16px 32px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.25; font-weight:700; color:#06193A; text-decoration:none; border-radius:999px;\">Open het live programma →</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>\n\n      \n\n      <!-- Afzender -->\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 12px 0;\"><div style=\"height:0; border-top:1px solid #2A3B60; font-size:0; line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div></td></tr>\n      <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:22px 12px 8px; text-align:center;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:'Unbounded','Arial Rounded MT Bold','Arial Black','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:-0.01em; color:#F6F7FB;\">— JVO</div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,'Courier New',monospace; font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#B9C2D8; margin-top:6px;\">Jeugdgroep van Oranje</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:10px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px;\"><a href=\"https://www.jvonl.nl\" style=\"color:#F6F7FB; text-decoration:underline;\">jvonl.nl</a></div>\n      </td></tr>\n\n      <tr><td style=\"padding:14px 12px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:11px; color:#B9C2D8; text-align:center; line-height:1.5;\">\n        Je ontvangt deze mail omdat je je hebt aangemeld voor de JVO Sportdag.<br/>\n        Vragen? Beantwoord deze mail of stuur naar <a href=\"mailto:contact@example.org\" style=\"color:#B9C2D8; text-decoration:underline;\">contact@example.org</a>\n      </td></tr>\n\n    </table>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>","text":"Hoi Captain,\n\nHet programma & tijdschema voor de JVO Sportdag.\n\nDatum: Zondag 22 november 2026\nLocatie: Sportcampus Zuiderpark, Den Haag (Mr. P. Droogleever Fortuynweg 22, 2533 SR Den Haag)\n\nDAGPROGRAMMA\n  08:00  Teams aanwezig — kleedkamers, inchecken, warming-up\n  08:30  Deuren open — inloop bezoekers\n  09:00  Aftrap toernooi — poulefase\n  Daarna  Knock-out — play-offs, kwart- en halve finales\n  Slotstuk  Finale & prijsuitreiking\n  ± 14:00  Einde — kan uitlopen (zie app voor de verwachte eindtijd)\n\nPOULE-INDELING\n\nLet op: de poule-indeling en je tegenstanders kunnen vóór aanvang nog veranderen — de app is altijd actueel.\n\nHoe werk je je naar de finale? De 4 poulewinnaars én de 2 beste nummers 2 gaan direct door naar de kwartfinale. De 2 laagste nummers 2 spelen samen met de 2 beste nummers 3 een play-off om de laatste 2 tickets. (10 door · 6 af · 8 in de kwartfinale). Poules → play-off → kwartfinale → halve finale → finale (+ duel om plek 3). Live op het bord zie je hoe jullie ervoor staan.\n\nLive programma (poules, schema, standen, uitslagen):\nhttps://sagek17.github.io/toernooi\n\nPoule-indeling, tegenstanders en tijden kunnen vóór het toernooi nog veranderen — de app is leidend. Neem je team-QR mee voor de check-in.\nSpelregels: https://sagek17.github.io/spelregels\n\nTot dan — en succes!\n\nOpen Mijn team: status, QR en je wedstrijden op één plek.\nhttps://sagek17.github.io/mijn\nBewaar deze mail: de link is je sleutel.\n\n— JVO\nJeugdgroep van Oranje · jvonl.nl\n","recipients":0}